WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.262
Bring the one-page ask, with
your four numbers filled in.

2
00:00:03.262 --> 00:00:07.878
Bring the external deadlines that apply
to your estate, candidate names for

3
00:00:07.878 --> 00:00:12.126
sponsor and steward, a proposed start
date, and a date for the first gate.

4
00:00:12.126 --> 00:00:15.763
And leave the room with one
decision recorded, whatever it is.

5
00:00:15.763 --> 00:00:20.917
To go deeper, go back to the Start Here
page, then Book 00 for the charter

6
00:00:20.917 --> 00:00:26.524
and the decisions, Book 01 for the roadmap,
and Book 03 for HR-driven identity.

7
00:00:26.524 --> 00:00:28.550
Every claim is footnoted there.

8
00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:30.650
Thank you for watching the Start series.
